  <title lang="en">MARS (AES Finalist)</title>
  <summary lang="en"><i>MARS (AES Finalist)</i></summary>
  <description lang="en">One block encrypted with the IBM cipher MARS.</description>
  <keywords lang="en">MARS, AES finalist, block cipher, IBM</keywords>
